  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPROVING HOUSEHOLD SURVEYS AND ADMINISTRATIVE DATA IN SUDAN STATISTICAL CAPACITY BUILDING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to strengthen the capacity of the Central Bureau of Statistics to improve the quality of household poverty survey data, and to improve the availability and quality of existing administrative data in the education and health sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
